      {
        "title": "Anung Un Rama",
        "content": "At the start of your turn, discard 1 card. Move Hellboy a number of spaces up to its BOOST value.\nAdd +2 to Hellboy's attacks.\nWhen you have 5 or fewer destiny cards in your discard pile, switch to OCCULT DETECTIVE."
      },
